~ start

Guide: You've come a long way since your first harvest.

Guide: Thanks to your hard work, Harvestia is beginning to come back to life.

Guide: But crops alone won't rebuild this village.

Guide: We'll need strong materials for the work ahead.

Guide: Take this old Pickaxe.

do GameDialogueManager.action_give_pickaxe()

Guide: Even though we're starting with Logs, you'll need the Pickaxe soon.

Guide: Head into the forest and collect 20 Logs.

=> END


~ progress

Guide: Keep gathering Logs.

Guide: Every piece of wood brings us one step closer to rebuilding Harvestia.

=> END


~ turn_in

Guide: Excellent work!

Guide: These Logs will be a great help.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Guide: Wood alone isn't enough.

Guide: Our next task is to gather Stone.

do QuestManager.start_quest("stone_foundation")

=> END


~ completed

Guide: Let's continue gathering materials.

=> END